      "document": "xai-grok-4-6"
    },
    {
      "text": "General and CBRN refusals improve versus Grok 4.5, with broad harmful-request compliance at 0.93%, child-safety compliance at 0.00%, and bio and chem refusal recall at 100.0%.",
      "pages": [36, 37],
      "document": "xai-grok-4-6"
    },
    {
      "text": "Behavioral and self-harm metrics regress versus Grok 4.5: self-harm compliance is 0.84%, MASK-Rectified dishonesty 1.90%, and sycophancy 0.04%.",
