  "limitations": [
    {
      "text": "The card requires human and domain-expert oversight for high-stakes medical, legal, financial, and safety-critical decisions.",
      "pages": [6],
      "document": "xai-grok-4-6"
    },
    {
      "text": "It states text and image input with text output, but gives no context window, maximum output, exact parameter count, or architecture details beyond a broad family scale.",
      "pages": [6, 7],
      "document": "xai-grok-4-6"
    },
    {
      "text": "The revision log records corrected results, making earlier copies of the card unreliable for several benchmark and safety figures.",
      "pages": [2],
      "document": "xai-grok-4-6"
    },
    {
      "text": "Factuality worsens versus the Grok 4.5 comparison row, and DeepSearchQA is lower than the Grok 4.5 row in the same chart.",
      "pages": [27, 28],
      "document": "xai-grok-4-6"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cyber and biology capability probes often run without production safeguards, so they are not normal deployed-behavior measurements.",
      "pages": [29, 32],
      "document": "xai-grok-4-6"
    },
    {
      "text": "The card reports no prompt-injection, reward-hacking, test-tampering, destructive-action, or sabotage evaluation for agentic coding workflows.",
